      ],
      "text": "A2.1 Scope and objectives",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.82879638671875,
        527.3681640625,
        321.2718200683594
      ],
      "text": "The WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis: tuberculosis preventive treatment make",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.02880859375,
        527.4042358398438,
        334.4718322753906
      ],
      "text": "recommendations for the four milestones of the cascade of preventive care, namely, identification of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.22882080078125,
        527.3849487304688,
        347.6718444824219
      ],
      "text": "risk groups, TB screening and ruling out TB, testing for TBI and choice and administration of the TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.4288330078125,
        435.52496337890625,
        360.8718566894531
      ],
      "text": "regimen. The second edition of the TPT guidelines covers the same milestones.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.8567199707031,
        527.4302978515625,
        382.57574462890625
      ],
      "text": "(1) Since the previous update of the guidelines on TPT, in 2020  , further developments have occurred",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.33270263671875,
        527.3999633789062,
        395.7757263183594
      ],
      "text": "that affect TPT policy. They include revision of WHO guidance on screening for TB disease and new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.2567138671875,
        527.44287109375,
        408.9757385253906
      ],
      "text": "(2,3) modalities for testing for TBI  . In addition, by 2023, two landmark trials of TPT for contacts of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.4568176269531,
        527.4684448242188,
        422.17584228515625
      ],
      "text": "(4,5) patients with MDR-TB had been completed  . In view of this new information and continued",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.9327087402344,
        527.4322509765625,
        435.375732421875
      ],
      "text": "demand by Member States for guidance on protecting people at risk of TB, a second edition of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.1327209472656,
        527.399169921875,
        448.57574462890625
      ],
      "text": "TPT guidelines has been prepared that includes the latest evidence. The objectives of this second",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.33270263671875,
        142.28469848632812,
        461.7757568359375
      ],
      "text": "to: edition were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.0367126464844,
        78.23609924316406,
        483.479736328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        469.0367126464844,
        527.4234008789062,
        483.479736328125
      ],
      "text": "review the latest evidence for TPT in cases of MDR-TB and revise the respective recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86611938476562,
        482.2367248535156,
        137.78802490234375,
        496.67974853515625
      ],
      "text": "accordingly;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.43670654296875,
        78.23609924316406,
        509.8797302246094
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        495.43670654296875,
        527.2553100585938,
        509.8797302246094
      ],
      "text": "align the guideline recommendations on ruling out TB and testing for TBI to the WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        508.63671875,
        483.89654541015625,
        523.0797119140625
      ],
      "text": "recommendations on screening and diagnostics that have been revised since 2020; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.836669921875,
        78.23609924316406,
        536.2796630859375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        521.836669921875,
        527.439208984375,
        536.2796630859375
      ],
      "text": "enhance the operational guidance with more practical details on dosing schedules, support for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        535.0367431640625,
        418.4826965332031,
        549.479736328125
      ],
      "text": "adherence to medication and minimizing the toxicity of current regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        556.7406005859375,
        527.4464111328125,
        571.18359375
      ],
      "text": "The aim of the revised guidelines is to support more effective global scaling up of TPT and to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        569.9406127929688,
        527.3815307617188,
        584.3836059570312
      ],
      "text": "contribute to ending the global TB epidemic. These updated guidelines will allow users to choose",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        583.140625,
        527.2230834960938,
        597.5836181640625
      ],
      "text": "the management approach best suited for all target groups in each context. It also provides a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        596.340576171875,
        527.380615234375,
        610.7835693359375
      ],
      "text": "sound basis for the development or updating of national guidelines for TPT, which is based on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.5405883789062,
        527.5662841796875,
        623.9835815429688
      ],
      "text": "epidemiology of TB and the health-care delivery system in each country. Furthermore, the guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990896224975586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.7406005859375,
        527.6084594726562,
        637.18359375
      ],
      "text": "address the request by Member States for a comprehensive policy and operational guidance for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.9406127929688,
        527.3946533203125,
        650.3836059570312
      ],
      "text": "programmatic management of TPT. The guidelines are being issued with an updated operational",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.140625,
        412.63397216796875,
        663.5836181640625
      ],
      "text": "handbook containing complementary, practical details for implementation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        674.0072021484375,
        360.0602111816406,
        692.2771606445312
      ],
      "text": "A2.2 Methods used to develop the guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
