        697.7070922851562,
        527.4171142578125,
        713.4260864257812
      ],
      "text": "(6) In accordance with the process recommended by the Guideline Review Committee  , three expert",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.1832275390625,
        527.53955078125,
        726.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "groups were established: a Guideline Steering Group, composed of WHO staff; the GDG, comprising",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999199867248535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
